OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABaby died after hospital monitor
OL,4,Avolume was too low
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has raised concerns after a
OL,7,Fboy died following a medical emergency
OL,8,Fthat went unnoticed because a hospital
OL,9,Fmonitor alarm was set too low.
OL,11,FIsmaeel Islam, who was under six months
OL,12,Fold, died at the Royal London
OL,13,FHospital's special care baby unit on 7
OL,14,FMarch 2025.
OL,16,FCoroner Mary Hassell said he suffered a
OL,17,Fdesaturation and respiratory arrest on
OL,18,F3 November 2024 which went unnoticed
OL,19,Ffor about 30 minutes because the
OL,20,Falarm's volume had been turned "too low
OL,21,Fto be usefully audible".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
