OL,3,GNEWSABaby died after hospital monitor
OL,4,Avolume was too low
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe coroner found this medical
OL,7,Femergency led to his death. She issued
OL,8,Fa Prevention of Future Deaths report to
OL,9,FMasimo UK, the maker of the monitoring
OL,10,Falarms used at the hospital. Masimo UK
OL,11,Fhas 56 days to respond.
